# Canvas Assignment AI Evaluator

AI-powered Canvas assignment downloader and evaluator using Groq LLMs.

Supports automatic:

* Downloading Canvas submissions
* Reading PDFs, DOCX, TXT, and code files
* AI-based evaluation using Groq
* Rubric-based grading
* Uploading grades back to Canvas
* Generating CSV reports

Based on:

* `Assignment-Downloader.py`
* `evaluate_assignments-groq.py`

---

# Features

## Assignment Downloader

* Downloads all student submissions from Canvas
* Supports parallel downloading
* Creates ZIP backup of submissions
* Extracts files automatically
* Handles:

  * File uploads
  * Text submissions
  * URL submissions

---

## AI Evaluator

* Fetches assignment rubric from Canvas
* Reads multiple file formats
* Evaluates using Groq AI models
* Generates:

  * Marks
  * Grades
  * Feedback
  * Strengths
  * Improvements
* Uploads grades directly to Canvas
* Exports results as CSV

