# Installation

## 1. Install Python

Download Python:

Python

```text
https://python.org
```

Verify installation:

### Windows

```bash
python --version
```

### Linux/macOS

```bash
python3 --version
```

---

## 2. Install Required Libraries

### Windows

```bash
pip install requests groq pandas python-docx pymupdf pillow openpyxl tqdm
```

### Linux/macOS

```bash
pip3 install requests groq pandas python-docx pymupdf pillow openpyxl tqdm
```

---

# Generate Groq API Key

The evaluator uses:

Groq

Open:

```text
https://console.groq.com
```

Steps:

1. Login
2. Open API Keys
3. Create API Key
4. Copy the key

Example:

```python
gsk_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
```

---

# Generate Canvas API Token

Open Canvas.

Go to:

```text
Account → Settings → Approved Integrations
```

Click:

```text
+ New Access Token
```

Copy generated token.

Example:

```python
7~xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
```

---

# Get Course ID

Open course URL.

Example:

```text
https://canvas.instructure.com/courses/14222223
```

Course ID:

```python
14222223
```

---

# Get Assignment ID

Open assignment URL.

Example:

```text
https://canvas.instructure.com/courses/14222223/assignments/62461759
```

Assignment ID:

```python
62461759
```

---

# Configuration

Edit both scripts.

Find:

```python
GROQ_API_KEY     = ""
CANVAS_API_TOKEN = ""
CANVAS_URL       = "https://canvas.instructure.com"
COURSE_ID        = ""
ASSIGNMENT_ID    = ""
```

Replace with your own values.

Example:

```python
GROQ_API_KEY     = "gsk_xxxxxxxxx"
CANVAS_API_TOKEN = "7~xxxxxxxxx"
CANVAS_URL       = "https://canvas.instructure.com"
COURSE_ID        = "14222223"
ASSIGNMENT_ID    = "62461759"
```

---

# Running Order

IMPORTANT:

Always run scripts in this order.

---

## Step 1 — Download Submissions

### Windows

```bash
python Assignment-Downloader.py
```

### Linux/macOS

```bash
python3 Assignment-Downloader.py
```

This will:

* Fetch submissions from Canvas
* Download all files
* Create ZIP backup
* Extract files into `submissions/`

---

## Step 2 — Evaluate Assignments

### Windows

```bash
python evaluate_assignments-groq.py
```

### Linux/macOS

```bash
python3 evaluate_assignments-groq.py
```

This will:

* Read assignment question
* Read rubric
* Evaluate student submissions
* Upload grades to Canvas
* Generate CSV report

